-FDT, and I'm about to consider the objection that someone might raise against that.\n\nI'm weighing whether the different observations matter, and the essay's rule is explicit that arrows only reach systems computing the same function on the same input. Checking the verdict across any prior on the other copy's node, sending the letter still comes out ahead, so I'll go with that.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm checking whether the other copy's different observation breaks the link to my own input, which would make defecting the dominant move under A-FDT, and I'm about to consider the objection that someone might raise against that.\n\nI'm weighing whether the different observations matter, and the essay's rule is explicit that arrows only reach systems computing the same function on the same input. Checking the verdict across any prior on the other copy's node, sending the letter still comes out ahead, so I'll go with that.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10698,"completion_tokens":989,"total_tokens":11687,"cost":0.062572,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.062572,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.042792,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01978},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":455,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}